@startuml
' Lab1 Phase 1 · SVG 编辑器 CLI 包图
' 箭头方向 = 依赖方向，反向箭头即架构违规。
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam ArrowColor #4a6fa5
skinparam packageBorderColor #4a6fa5

title Lab1 Phase 1 · 模块划分与依赖方向

package "交互层\nRepl / Tokenizer / CommandRegistry" as cli
package "命令层\nCommand / CommandHistory / Session\nCreate Delete Move Scale\nGroup Ungroup AddTo Reorder\nSet / Tree Show + Renderers\nRead Save Canvas Init" as commands
package "模型层\nDocument / ShapeFactory / CommandError" as model
package "图形层\nShape / Rect Circle Ellipse Line Text\nContainerShape" as shapes
package "持久化层\nSvgReader / SvgWriter" as io

cli --> commands
cli ..> model : error:
commands --> model
commands --> shapes
model --> shapes
io --> model
io --> shapes

note bottom of shapes
  唯一不依赖其他模块的一层：
  可脱离编辑器单独测试，
  也是插件化阶段唯一要扩展的层。
end note

note right of commands
  Command 模式的落点。
  每条命令一个类，
  execute / undo 成对，
  撤销靠属性快照。
end note
@enduml
